                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I just don't get it... I expected to like this but I guess it wasn't for me. You walk and walk and walk, and occasionally you see a person who either runs or tries to shoot you. You can teleport them to your ship if you manage to get close enough to them but normally they just run away - and it doesn't explain why you're teleporting them or if you're even supposed to be doing that. And that seems to be the whole game from the few minutes I played before I quickly got bored. The art and music were good but that was about it.",
